      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Elevating Lives Through the Power of Generosity</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Our mission is to elevate lives through the power of generosity by providing excellent donor services, making impactful grants to benefit the community, ensuring sustainability within the philanthropic sector, and serving as a leader, catalyst, and resource.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Foundation manages community assets and coordinates community-wide giving over six weeks that culminates in the annual Tin Cup Challenge Event Day, a major fundraising event for local nonprofits.</p>
